T*
() Tj
T*
(The demand-forecasting platform supplied by Northwind Analytics reached a) Tj
T*
(weighted mean absolute percentage error of 8.4 percent across all) Tj
T*
(warehouses, against a target of 10 percent. Accuracy was weakest in the) Tj
T*
(Lyon region during the second quarter.) Tj
