T*
() Tj
T*
(On 14 August 2026 the refrigeration unit at the Rotterdam cross-dock failed) Tj
T*
(during a heat warning. The root cause of the cold chain failure was a) Tj
T*
(blocked condenser coil that had been flagged in the June inspection but was) Tj
T*
(not scheduled for cleaning, because the maintenance backlog was ranked by) Tj
T*
ET
